# Phone landscape (844 x 390, DPR 3): the title, a Practice board generated on the worker with the HUD as a
# status column at the left and the tray as a column at the right, a fill and a mark by touch, a drag painting
# a run, the pause sheet from the HUD's Pause and Leave puzzle; then lesson 2's banner docked at the top left.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Read the clues
frames 10
save title-landscape
touch =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch =Practice
until 120 Custom seed
frames 10
touch =Calm · 8×8
until 900 Row 1, column 1, unknown
frames 150
save round-landscape
touch =Mark
frames 6
touch =Row 8, column 8, unknown
frames 6
expect Row 8, column 8, crossed
touch =Fill
frames 6
touch =Hint
frames 20
swipe 38% 52% 66% 52% 12
frames 20
save painted-landscape
touch =Pause game
until 120 The board waits
frames 10
save pause-landscape
touch =Leave puzzle
until 120 Read the clues
frames 10
touch =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch =Learn
until 120 One rule at a time
frames 10
save learn-landscape
touch =2. Cross the Gaps
until 300 step 1/
frames 120
save lesson-landscape
touch =Row 1, column 1, unknown
frames 10
expect step 2/5
